	(text "STM32H750VBT6, LQFP-100: the smallest-pin-count H750. Pin map kept from the Timekeeper where the package allows: SAI1 on PE2-PE6, codec control PC14/PC15/PB8/PB4, relay PC10, SWD PA13/PA14/PB3, HSE 25 MHz.\nQUADSPI moves to bank 2 (PB2 CLK, PC11 NCS, PE7-PE10 IO0-3) because PF6-PF10 do not exist on LQFP-100 and bank 1 IO2 would take PE2 from SAI1: set FSEL=1 in firmware. [CONFIRM AFs in CubeMX]"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left bottom)
			)
		(uuid "77216af3-20f1-468b-b5e1-2bfd8a97744a")
	)
